  "body": "Adds an end-to-end headless MCP test for `Plasma Profile` on `Tormach 1300PL`, updates the `post` tool schema description in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`, and documents the plasma workflow in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n\n## Context\n\n- `Tormach 1300PL` (`assets/machines/tormach-1300pl.mch`), `ToolKind::Torch` (`PT-KERF-150` in `assets/tools/catalog.json`), `OpType::PlasmaProfile`, and `Tormach PathPilot Plasma` (`assets/posts/tormach-plasma.cps`) already shipped.\n- Zero tests or documentation entries currently mention `plasma`, `1300pl`, or `torch` across `crates/app/src/mcp/`, `crates/app/tests/*mcp*`, and `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n- `s_post` in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` still lists only legacy built-in post names and omits `Tormach PathPilot Plasma`.\n- `verify` (`crates/app/src/mcp/job.rs`) runs `posting::verification_report`, which returns the 2D plasma clause in `gate.not_judged` and blocking failures in `gate.problems`.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Add `crates/app/tests/mcp_plasma.rs` (following `crates/app/tests/mcp_wire_contour.rs`).\n- Test `load_machine` with `\"Tormach 1300PL\"`, `add_tool` with `\"PT-KERF-150\"`, `add_operation` with `\"Plasma Profile\"`, `edit_operation`, `generate`, `verify`, `undo` and `redo`, and `post` with `\"Tormach PathPilot Plasma\"`.\n- Assert clean refusal messages when an MCP client assigns a non-torch tool, asks for nonzero rpm, uses a milling post on `Tormach 1300PL`, or posts with bad cut order.\n- Update `s_post` in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` so the description includes `\"Tormach PathPilot Plasma\"`.\n- Add a Plasma Profile workflow section to `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n\nDone means: `crates/app/tests/mcp_plasma.rs` passes all end-to-end and refusal cases, `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` names `Tormach PathPilot Plasma`, and `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` documents the Plasma Profile MCP workflow.\n\nPart of #621\n",
